      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00000000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 2,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "기다리고 있었습니다.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 464,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "AE30B2E4B9ACACE00020C788C5C8C2B5B2C8B2E4002E00100002011400160000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 16
    },
    {
      "displayText": "유카리 님께서 기다리고 계십니다.\n미르 소셜 배틀 클럽의<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n배틀코트로 이동해 주시죠.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 496,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C720CE74B9AC0020B2D8AED8C11C0020AE30B2E4B9ACACE00020ACC4C2EDB2C8B2E4002E000ABBF8B9740020C18CC15C0020BC30D2C00020D074B7FDC75800100001BE00000ABC30D2C0CF54D2B8B85C0020C774B3D9D5740020C8FCC2DCC8E0002E00100002011400160000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 54
    },
    {
      "displayText": "지하로 내려가시라는 뜻입니다.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n유카리 님을 기다리게 해서\n좋을 게 없다는 것은 잘 아실 텐데요.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 604,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C9C0D558B85C0020B0B4B824AC00C2DCB77CB2940020B73BC785B2C8B2E4002E00100001BE01000AC720CE74B9AC0020B2D8C7440020AE30B2E4B9ACAC8C0020D574C11C000AC88BC7440020AC8C0020C5C6B2E4B2940020AC83C7400020C7980020C544C2E40020D150B370C694002E00100002011400160000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 61
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0004>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 728,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00040000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000> 님.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 740,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002010000000020B2D8002E00100002011400150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 12
    },
    {
      "displayText": "A랭크 달성 기념 소원으로\nZA로열∞의 개최를 희망해 주셔서<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n진심으로 감사해요.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 764,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0041B7ADD06C0020B2ECC1310020AE30B1500020C18CC6D0C73CB85C000A005A0041B85CC5F4221EC7580020AC1CCD5CB97C0020D76CB9DDD5740020C8FCC154C11C00100001BE00000AC9C4C2ECC73CB85C0020AC10C0ACD574C694002E00100002011400150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 52
    },
    {
      "displayText": "너무 기쁜 나머지 제 쪽에서도\n독자적인 대회를 개최하기로 했답니다!<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n이름하여...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 868,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B108BB340020AE30C05C0020B098BA38C9C00020C81C0020CABDC5D0C11CB3C4000AB3C5C790C801C7780020B300D68CB97C0020AC1CCD5CD558AE30B85C0020D588B2F5B2C8B2E4002100100001BE00000AC774B984D558C5EC002E002E002E00100002011400150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 53
    },
    {
      "displayText": "슈퍼 유카리 토너먼트 D!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 976,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C288D37C0020C720CE74B9AC0020D1A0B108BA3CD2B800200044002100100002011400150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000> 님,\n여기서 <U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>D<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000>가 무슨 뜻인지 아시겠나요?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 12,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 1016,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002010000000020B2D8002C000AC5ECAE30C11C002000100002FF000006004400100002FF000000AC000020BB34C2A80020B73BC778C9C00020C544C2DCACA0B098C694003F00100002011400150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 41
    },
    {
      "displayText": "디럭스?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1100,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B514B7EDC2A4003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "대단해?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1112,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B300B2E8D574003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "단둘이?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 1124,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B2E8B458C774003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "됐네요",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 1136,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B410B124C6940000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "아쉽지만 땡이랍니다! 저란 존재 자체가\n이미 디럭스라 그런 건 붙일 필요 없다구요.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 1144,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C544C27DC9C0B9CC0020B561C774B78DB2C8B2E400210020C800B7800020C874C7AC0020C790CCB4AC00000AC774BBF80020B514B7EDC2A4B77C0020ADF8B7F00020AC740020BD99C77C0020D544C6940020C5C6B2E4AD6CC694002E00100002011400150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 51
    },
    {
      "displayText": "아까워라! 저도 제가 대단하다고 생각하지만\n정답은 아니에요.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 1248,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C544AE4CC6CCB77C00210020C800B3C40020C81CAC000020B300B2E8D558B2E4ACE00020C0DDAC01D558C9C0B9CC000AC815B2F5C7400020C544B2C8C5D0C694002E00100002011400150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 38
    },
    {
      "displayText": "정말 대단하세요!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 1324,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C815B9D00020B300B2E8D558C138C694002100100002011400150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 14
    },
    {
      "displayText": "됐네요라니 무례하시군요!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 1352,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B410B124C694B77CB2C80020BB34B840D558C2DCAD70C694002100100002011400150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "당신과 유카리 단둘만의 토너먼트!\n그게 바로 슈퍼 유카리 토너먼트 D랍니다!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 1388,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B2F9C2E0ACFC0020C720CE74B9AC0020B2E8B458B9CCC7580020D1A0B108BA3CD2B80021000AADF8AC8C0020BC14B85C0020C288D37C0020C720CE74B9AC0020D1A0B108BA3CD2B800200044B78DB2C8B2E4002100100002011400150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 47
    },
    {
      "displayText": "이겨도 이겨도 계속 저와의 승부!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 1484,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C774ACA8B3C40020C774ACA8B3C40020ACC4C18D0020C800C640C7580020C2B9BD80002100100002011400150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "우승해도 하지 못해도\n몇 번이고 제게 도전하실 수 있어요!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 1532,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C6B0C2B9D574B3C40020D558C9C00020BABBD574B3C4000ABA870020BC88C774ACE00020C81CAC8C0020B3C4C804D558C2E40020C2180020C788C5B4C694002100100002011400150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 37
    },
    {
      "displayText": "자, 무슨 말인지 이해되셨나요?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 1608,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C790002C0020BB34C2A80020B9D0C778C9C00020C774D574B418C168B098C694003F00100002011400150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "됐어요",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 1652,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B410C5B4C6940000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "됐을 리가요",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 1660,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B410C7440020B9ACAC00C6940000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 7
    },
    {
      "displayText": "바로 D를 활용해서 답하시다니!\n역시 <U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000> 님이세요!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 1676,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BC14B85C00200044B97C0020D65CC6A9D574C11C0020B2F5D558C2DCB2E4B2C80021000AC5EDC2DC002000100002010000000020B2D8C774C138C694002100100002011400150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "이런 이런...<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n제 목소리를 더 듣고 싶은 건 이해하지만\n그런 식으로 답하시는 건 좋지 않아요.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 1748,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C774B7F00020C774B7F0002E002E002E00100001BE01000AC81C0020BAA9C18CB9ACB97C0020B3540020B4E3ACE00020C2F6C7400020AC740020C774D574D558C9C0B9CC000AADF8B7F00020C2DDC73CB85C0020B2F5D558C2DCB2940020AC740020C88BC9C00020C54AC544C694002E00100002011400150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 61
    },
    {
      "displayText": "일단 시작하도록 할까요?\n직접 체험해 보는 게 베스트니까요!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 1872,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C77CB2E80020C2DCC791D558B3C4B85D0020D560AE4CC694003F000AC9C1C8110020CCB4D5D8D5740020BCF4B2940020AC8C0020BCA0C2A4D2B8B2C8AE4CC694002100100002011400150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 38
    },
    {
      "displayText": "토너먼트를 시작한다",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 1948,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D1A0B108BA3CD2B8B97C0020C2DCC791D55CB2E40000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 11
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그만둔다",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 1972,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ADF8B9CCB454B2E40000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "충고 하나 해 드리자면\n참가하시는 게 신상에 이로우실 겁니다.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 1984,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "CDA9ACE00020D558B0980020D5740020B4DCB9ACC790BA74000ACC38AC00D558C2DCB2940020AC8C0020C2E0C0C1C5D00020C774B85CC6B0C2E40020AC81B2C8B2E4002E00100002011400160000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 39
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+001E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 2064,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF001E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "아쉬운 시합이었네요...\n다음 도전을 기다릴게요.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 2076,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C544C26CC6B40020C2DCD569C774C5C8B124C694002E002E002E000AB2E4C74C0020B3C4C804C7440020AE30B2E4B9B4AC8CC694002E00100002011400150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿 ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 32,
      "offsetInSection": 2140,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00200000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "제게서 승리를 쟁취하신 것을\n진심으로 축복해 드리겠어요.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 33,
      "offsetInSection": 2152,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C81CAC8CC11C0020C2B9B9ACB97C0020C7C1CDE8D558C2E00020AC83C744000AC9C4C2ECC73CB85C0020CD95BCF5D5740020B4DCB9ACACA0C5B4C694002E00100002011400150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "포켓몬을 건강하게 만들어 드리겠습니다.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 34,
      "offsetInSection": 2224,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D3ECCF13BAACC7440020AC74AC15D558AC8C0020B9CCB4E4C5B40020B4DCB9ACACA0C2B5B2C8B2E4002E00100002011400160000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "다음 대전 상대도\n물론 저예요.<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n시합을 계속하시겠어요?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 35,
      "offsetInSection": 2276,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B2E4C74C0020B300C8040020C0C1B300B3C4000ABB3CB8600020C800C608C694002E00100001BE00000AC2DCD569C7440020ACC4C18DD558C2DCACA0C5B4C694003F00100002011400150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 38
    },
    {
      "displayText": "...할게요!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 36,
      "offsetInSection": 2352,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "002E002E002ED560AC8CC69400210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 8
    },
    {
      "displayText": "잠시만요",
