      "offsetInSection": 2380,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "제게서 승리를 쟁취하신 것을\n진심으로 축복해 드리겠어요.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 39,
      "offsetInSection": 2392,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C81CAC8CC11C0020C2B9B9ACB97C0020C7C1CDE8D558C2E00020AC83C744000AC9C4C2ECC73CB85C0020CD95BCF5D5740020B4DCB9ACACA0C5B4C694002E00100002011400150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "포켓몬을 건강하게 만들어 드리겠습니다.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 40,
      "offsetInSection": 2464,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D3ECCF13BAACC7440020AC74AC15D558AC8C0020B9CCB4E4C5B40020B4DCB9ACACA0C2B5B2C8B2E4002E00100002011400160000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "준결승 상대도\n물론 저예요.<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n시합을 계속하시겠어요?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 41,
      "offsetInSection": 2516,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C900ACB0C2B90020C0C1B300B3C4000ABB3CB8600020C800C608C694002E00100001BE00000AC2DCD569C7440020ACC4C18DD558C2DCACA0C5B4C694003F00100002011400150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
